   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Big detailed upscale. The picture is enlarged with 4x-UltraSharp, resized to Output size (megapixels: 4 ≈ 2048×2048, 8 ≈ 2900×2900),\ncut into 768px tiles that are each redrawn at denoise 0.3, and stitched back.\nDenoise: 0.2 = just sharper, 0.3 = new fine detail, higher may change faces or add things.\nThe prompt should describe the picture in general terms (style, quality); it applies to every tile.\nTile overlap hides the seams (128 is safe).\n\nModel: SD 1.5 checkpoints (realistic or anime). Default: Realistic Vision 6.\nDefaults: 25 steps, CFG 6.0, dpmpp_2m / karras."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
